<title>USA: Ramapo restores $0.02 per share dividend.</title>
<headline>Ramapo restores $0.02 per share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ramapo Financial Corp, parent of Ramapo Bank, said Thursday its board has declared a common stock dividend of $0.02 per share payable to shareholders of record as of September 30. Payment will be October 15, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it had consolidated total assets of about $248.7 million on June 30.</p>
